          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 92b03138bac022b1f2b4e7d9befc64bcbf4a341a2c69f573cb2d172e209eb668\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: b92cccf9a63b08507cc8f96c80c7e7976634036a5677a5b151e9aea4a180ef13\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Configure SSH to use FIPS-validated HMAC for remote maintenance sessions as shown in the following example:\n\nSSH Example\n\nR1(config)#ip ssh version 2\nR1(config)#ip ssh server algorithm mac hmac-sha2-256",
