        {
          "comments": "NOT REVIEWED — raw running config supplied for manual review; no automated pass, finding, or applicability decision asserted.",
          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: 92b03138bac022b1f2b4e7d9befc64bcbf4a341a2c69f573cb2d172e209eb668\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: b92cccf9a63b08507cc8f96c80c7e7976634036a5677a5b151e9aea4a180ef13\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "Configure the Cisco router to implement cryptographic mechanisms to protect the confidentiality of remote maintenance sessions using a FIPS 140-2 approved algorithm as shown in the examples below.\n\nSSH Example\n\nR1(config)#ip ssh server algorithm encryption aes256-ctr aes192-ctr aes128-ctr\n                         \nHTTPS Example\n\nR2(config)#ip http secure-ciphersuite aes-128-cbc-sha",
          "group_id": "V-215700",
          "group_id_src": "V-215700",
          "group_title": "SRG-APP-000412-NDM-000331",
          "rule_id": "SV-215700r961557_rule",
